From 62038e74ed2145a4f7da696507e405bc4156f6e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 05:18:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add presence-only multiplayer

Other players are shown as non-interactive ghost characters with synced
position, rotation and animation, via a small WebSocket relay server.
Existing gameplay is unchanged; without a server the game runs as before.
